date-released: 2025-06-07
abstract: >-
  The Ananta Theory proposes a universe woven from information, seeking
  to resolve the fragmentation between relativity, quantum mechanics,
  and consciousness. It reinterprets dark matter as the gravitational
  memory of the 'Recorded Past' (Pμν), posits that time emerges
  from the interaction of past and future flows at 'Nexus Points' (black holes),
  and resolves quantum paradoxes via the 'Ananta Transaction'.
keywords:
  - cosmology
  - information theory
  - theoretical physics
  - consciousness
  - dark matter
  - emergent time
  - quantum mechanics
  - Ananta Theory
